WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:01,740
Sister Weiwei Zhao Ya and Lin Shiyu

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,580
Stuffing grass under the grass. Stuffing grass.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,660
It's so hot, why are you stuffing grass? They have too much to do.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,220
