15
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,420
Put it on the inside so it doesn't get touched

16
00:00:48,760 --> 00:01:05,110
What are you two afraid of sleeping with me?

17
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:07,460
The rain on the island just comes and goes quickly

18
